", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "233037207", "author": {"steamid": "76561198053023275", "personaname": "emarcius778", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198053023275/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 1640, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1640, "last_played": 1786960119, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game is way too easy.Not having to calculate or lead your shots is a huge disappointment.Playing on Autentic difficulty and you still have two white stripes showing how much adjust for shoot it's crazy,easy mod should not exist,the game industry,its so bad ,with all its easy mode,markers,xray act,completely killing sense of reword", "timestamp_created": 1786960931, "timestamp_updated": 1786960931, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.40677914023399353", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}]}